WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:30.650
Every time I look up to the sky after the rain

3
00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:36.160
I think back to when I was a crybaby

4
00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:43.900
I was chasing somebody's back blindly

5
00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:46.880
Thinking "I want to be stronger"

6
00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:52.060
The word "thank you" has faded into the wind now

7
00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:57.240
Am I getting stronger?

8
00:00:57.440 --> 00:01:02.910
I don't know the answer yet

9
00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:08.430
That's why I'll keep walking ahead

10
00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:11.060
So let's go

11
00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:14.270
Without stopping

12
00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:19.510
Without giving up to the flow of time

13
00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:25.120
I'll keep getting back up

14
00:01:25.130 --> 00:01:30.760
Because I don't want to lose something precious

15
00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:35.880
The voice inside of me

16
00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:41.280
keeps sustaining me

17
00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:46.410
Wicked rain will get in my way

18
00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:51.350
But I won't walk away

19
00:01:54.450 --> 00:01:56.810
So let's go

20
00:01:56.810 --> 00:02:00.090
Without stopping

21
00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:05.380
Without giving up to the flow of time

22
00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:11.020
I'll keep getting back up

23
00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:16.380
Because I don't want to lose something precious

24
00:02:16.390 --> 00:02:22.080
To the future I believe in...

25
00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:38.000
There's a tunnel of fire in the smoke!

26
00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:41.600
You've always been like this!

27
00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:42.740
Luffy!

28
00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:48.740
You've never listened to me...

29
00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:56.960
and you've always done crazy things like this!

30
00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:07.130
Ace!!

31
00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:41.370
F-Fire Fist Ace is...

32
00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:45.540
now free!

33
00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:48.930
Great! You did it, Straw Hat!

34
00:03:48.930 --> 00:03:51.280
He rescued Ace!

35
00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:57.680
He has been relentless since
Impel Down! That guy is really...

36
00:03:57.680 --> 00:04:00.360
Something else!

37
00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:06.800
Don't lose your cool! Be ready to fire!

38
00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:08.600
Shoot them when they land!

39
00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:09.160
Yes, sir!

40
00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:14.700
Stay alert, Luffy! Let's split up for now!

41
00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:15.500
Okay!

42
00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:18.390
Oh no!

43
00:04:21.310 --> 00:04:23.810
Flame Commandment!

44
00:04:25.050 --> 00:04:26.440
Fire Pillar!

45
00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:45.030
He's strong! Be careful!

46
00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:51.540
Can you fight, Luffy?

47
00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:53.210
Of course!

48
00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:57.080
Ace-san! Luffy-kun!

49
00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:02.580
Remember! Fire Fist
Ace is fire- he's a Logia!

50
00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:08.140
I never thought that you'd be the one saving me.

51
00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:09.950
Thanks, Luffy!

52
00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:16.030
Old guy Whitebeard and the others helped me out!

53
00:05:17.430 --> 00:05:19.790
Don't think that you're safe now!

54
00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:24.540
Your execution will take place here now!

55
00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:36.610
Now's our chance!

56
00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:38.460
I'll cut you to pieces!

57
00:05:43.010 --> 00:05:46.660
He's my brother! Leave him alone!

58
00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:51.530
Fire Fist!

59
00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:59.440
They make a good team.

60
00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:02.270
Clear the way so they can get away!

61
00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:08.860
Don't let them get away at any cost!

62
00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:12.450
Firefly!

63
00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:15.410
Fiery Doll!

64
00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:21.830
Execute Fire Fist and Straw Hat!

65
00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:24.300
Rubber-Rubber...

66
00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:28.270
Jet Gatling!

67
00:06:46.470 --> 00:06:49.140
You've gotten stronger, Luffy!

68
00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:01.600
I'll be stronger than you someday!

69
00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:11.040
In that case, I'll protect you for now.

70
00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:12.280
That bastard!

71
00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:16.640
Ice Block!

72
00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:18.720
Stand aside, Luffy.

73
00:07:20.390 --> 00:07:22.380
Pheasant Beak!

74
00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:23.950
Mirror Flame!

75
00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:46.810
Fleet Admiral-dono!

76
00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:51.520
I can't believe this blunder!
Even I couldn't stop it!

77
00:07:54.210 --> 00:07:58.660
Let them go! That way, things
will be more interesting!

78
00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:00.250
Cut the crap!

79
00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:03.680
Even an admiral's power
is useless against them!

80
00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:05.800
How can we fight them?!

81
00:08:05.800 --> 00:08:07.830
Don't lose your head!

82
00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:11.240
Admiral Sakazuki!

83
00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:16.470
We won't let them get away from here!

84
00:08:17.610 --> 00:08:20.110
Mr. 2...

85
00:08:20.110 --> 00:08:24.930
I hardly granted your wish.

86
00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:28.800
And now, I need to hurry and escape...

87
00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:31.160
To whom does this traitor owe allegiance?!

88
00:08:32.550 --> 00:08:35.850
No, he's a prisoner impersonating a guard!

89
00:08:35.850 --> 00:08:37.630
Oh no!

90
00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:46.640
Heads up, everyone! Their ship is moving!

91
00:08:46.640 --> 00:08:49.840
Don't get close! It's running
on the ground with its paddles!

92
00:08:50.490 --> 00:08:52.640
Hey, who's controlling it?

93
00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:56.700
Squard!

94
00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:58.950
The Whirl Spider Pirates!

95
00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:05.120
Pops, everyone, run!

96
00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:08.930
Leave the war to us!

97
00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:16.270
Those fools!

98
00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:29.750
Don't be stupid, Squard!

99
00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:32.420
Obviously, you have a death wish!

100
00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:38.840
Of course I do.

101
00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:42.990
What I did to Pops was horrible.

102
00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:52.150
Even if this doesn't make amends for it,

103
00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:55.560
I can't let things go like this!

104
00:09:58.280 --> 00:10:02.750
I'm sorry, guys. I shouldn't have let you come with me.

105
00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:05.700
It's okay, Captain! Don't worry!

106
00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:07.950
We followed you because we wanted to!

107
00:10:07.950 --> 00:10:10.490
We'll choose where to die on our own!

108
00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:13.930
Captain! We'll follow you to the end!

109
00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:16.480
I'm sorry...

110
00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:21.330
Everybody, take Ace and run!

111
00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:23.740
St. Elmo's Fire!

112
00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:30.880
Fool!

113
00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:37.380
Damn Squard! That's not
the smart way to do it!

114
00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:40.890
Hey! Hurry up and get these cuffs off me!

115
00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:49.620
What happened?!

116
00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:52.500
The ship stopped moving!

117
00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:01.970
Pops!

118
00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:15.850
Can't you understand how
ungrateful it is for a child...

119
00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:20.660
to die before his parent, Squard?!

120
00:11:22.100 --> 00:11:23.930
Don't get too confident!

121
00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:30.670
The stab wound you gave me isn't going to kill me!

122
00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:34.190
Everybody grows old and dies eventually!

123
00:11:43.410 --> 00:11:46.550
We accomplished our goal here!

124
00:11:46.550 --> 00:11:51.000
There's no need for us to keep fighting here!

125
00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:53.760
Pops!

126
00:11:57.960 --> 00:12:02.810
Listen carefully, Whitebeard Pirates!

127
00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:10.780
I'm going to give you all my final order as your captain!

128
00:12:10.780 --> 00:12:15.380
"Final order"?!
Wait a second, Pops! That sounds sad!

129
00:12:15.380 --> 00:12:17.650
I don't want to hear that!

130
00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:20.320
Let's go back to the New World together!

131
00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:24.520
Cross Fire!

132
00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:26.560
Pops!

133
00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:30.040
It is time for us to part ways!

134
00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:36.800
Everyone, survive at any cost and
return to the New World safely!

135
00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:48.460
P-Pops! Are you planning to die here?!

136
00:12:48.460 --> 00:12:52.780
I'm a relic of a bygone era!

137
00:12:52.780 --> 00:12:58.160
There is no ship that can carry me into the new age!

138
00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:04.960
Escape from here, everyone!

139
00:13:15.300 --> 00:13:16.810
Whitebeard!

140
00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:19.350
No, Pops!

141
00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:21.680
He gave us an order! We need to go!

142
00:13:21.680 --> 00:13:22.970
Old guy!

143
00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:24.770
Pops!

144
00:13:38.530 --> 00:13:40.830
This is unbelievable!

145
00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:44.590
Hey, why do you look so out of spirits?

146
00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:47.720
Join us! There's more than enough treasure!

147
00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:53.010
Never mind that guy.
He's not interested in treasures.

148
00:13:53.010 --> 00:13:57.450
That's odd! What kind of pirate is he?

149
00:13:57.450 --> 00:14:00.660
What is it that you want?

150
00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:03.140
Hey, Newgate!

151
00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:09.030
I've been traveling a very long time.

152
00:14:09.900 --> 00:14:12.640
Let's get it over with!

153
00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:14.600
Navy!

154
00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:20.860
Marineford is in danger!

155
00:14:20.860 --> 00:14:22.800
Stop Whitebeard!

156
00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:24.040
<b>Absolute Justice</b>

157
00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:28.450
He's willing to destroy the whole island!

158
00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:31.000
Pops!

159
00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:34.560
I don't wanna leave you!
You gotta come with us!

160
00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:37.150
Pops!

161
00:14:37.150 --> 00:14:40.190
Are you going to disobey your captain's orders?!

162
00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:42.820
Escape from here, you brats!

163
00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:47.200
Now is our chance! Kill
Whitebeard! He's dying already!

164
00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:55.370
Pops!

165
00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:58.490
Hurry up! Let's do as Pops said!

166
00:14:58.490 --> 00:15:01.980
You don't mind leaving Pops behind?!

167
00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:03.590
Yeah!

168
00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:07.390
Stupid! No one wants to leave him behind!

169
00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:08.290
Then...

170
00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:10.770
Grumbling about it at a time like this...

171
00:15:10.770 --> 00:15:14.520
is the same as trampling on Pops' determination!

172
00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:17.330
Don't you understand?!

173
00:15:20.360 --> 00:15:21.930
Pops!

174
00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:28.210
Hurry and get ready to sail out!

175
00:15:29.670 --> 00:15:30.910
Ace!

176
00:15:44.690 --> 00:15:48.060
We're gonna leave soon! Hurry up and board the ship!

177
00:15:55.480 --> 00:15:57.970
Commander Marco, let's go!

178
00:15:59.070 --> 00:16:01.070
Pops...

179
00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:04.280
Fleet Admiral Sengoku!

180
00:16:04.280 --> 00:16:07.780
Since he isn't concerned about
Fire Fist Ace anymore...

181
00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:12.920
It's clear that his intention is to
sink Marineford into the ocean.

182
00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:15.790
Along with himself!

183
00:16:16.430 --> 00:16:18.560
Vice Admiral Garp! You're all right!

184
00:16:19.190 --> 00:16:23.920
He wants to bring this era to a close?
I guess the time is right.

185
00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:27.150
What happened to Whitebeard?!

186
00:16:27.150 --> 00:16:31.370
Are the allies he sold out all dead now?!

187
00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:34.720
What is happening at Marineford right now?!

188
00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:36.540
What?!

189
00:16:36.540 --> 00:16:39.680
The Transponder Snail isn't coming out?!

190
00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:47.220
Damn! Captain Buggy is about to defeat
Whitebeard! There's no time for this!

191
00:16:47.220 --> 00:16:49.740
Don't say it like it's an easy thing to do!

192
00:16:49.740 --> 00:16:53.990
He may be dying, but he's still super strong! Have they been paying attention?!

193
00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:59.240
Why did I tell them I was going to defeat that man?!
I really messed up!

194
00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:02.660
I can't do it! It's impossible!

195
00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:07.960
What?! We gotta broadcast Captain
Buggy's big moment all over the world!

196
00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:11.300
Get it out at any cost!

197
00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:13.890
Come out now!

198
00:17:13.890 --> 00:17:15.720
Or we're gonna burn you out of it!

199
00:17:16.650 --> 00:17:19.550
The Transponder Snail came out on its own!

200
00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:22.990
Alright, capture my bravery!

201
00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:25.850
Hey, look!

202
00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:26.890
The video is back!

203
00:17:26.890 --> 00:17:28.200
Um, well...

204
00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:30.730
Transponder Snail, go lower!

205
00:17:34.150 --> 00:17:38.570
Hi, everyone! I'm Buggy and I'm a legend!

206
00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:41.600
You again?!

207
00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:43.780
Get to the sea now!

208
00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:49.240
We survivors need to return to the New World safely!

209
00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:52.820
Don't let them get away!
Kill as many as you can!

210
00:17:52.820 --> 00:17:57.500
I'm the only one that you
ought to worry about!

211
00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:02.590
Commander Jozu!

212
00:18:02.590 --> 00:18:06.340
He's badly injured, but he should be fine!

213
00:18:06.340 --> 00:18:08.710
Our Captain gave us an order! Come with us!

214
00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:13.640
Blenheim! You gotta carry Jozu!

215
00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:18.780
Straw Hat-boy! Why are you standing around?!

216
00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:21.880
Ace, let's go! The old man
has made up his mind...

217
00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:31.320
I know! And it won't be in vain!

218
00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:36.040
Back off, you bastards!

219
00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:25.910
We don't need words now.

220
00:19:32.970 --> 00:19:36.830
Just tell me one thing, Ace.

221
00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:44.820
Were you happy to have me as your father?

222
00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:53.120
You still tryin' to stand up?

223
00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:56.770
I'd hate to see you die here, kid.

224
00:19:56.770 --> 00:20:03.280
If you still want to fight, then take my name and roam the seas wild and free!

225
00:20:04.110 --> 00:20:06.380
Become my son!

226
00:20:15.640 --> 00:20:17.930
Of course I am!

227
00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:35.080
Run! Run to the ship!

228
00:20:37.280 --> 00:20:40.400
Ace-san, Luffy-kun, get in front of me!

229
00:20:40.400 --> 00:20:41.320
Jinbe!

230
00:20:41.320 --> 00:20:43.910
They want to get you two!

231
00:20:43.910 --> 00:20:48.460
But Pops wants there to be as many survivors as possible!

232
00:20:48.460 --> 00:20:49.780
Pops!

233
00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:54.930
We've stolen a Navy ship! Get on board quickly!

234
00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:04.880
Do they really think that they can
get away?! What a simple bunch.

235
00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:06.980
Admiral Sakazuki!

236
00:21:06.980 --> 00:21:10.550
You guys, move aside a little bit!

237
00:21:19.720 --> 00:21:23.290
You two, just keep going
until you reach the ship!

238
00:21:26.120 --> 00:21:29.690
As soon as you rescue
Fire Fist Ace, you run!

239
00:21:29.690 --> 00:21:33.570
The Whitebeard Pirates must be a group of cowards!

240
00:21:33.570 --> 00:21:34.710
What?!

241
00:21:34.710 --> 00:21:37.270
He's obviously trying to stir us up!

242
00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:40.580
If you stop, you'll just be playing into his hands!

243
00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:46.660
Well, considering who your captain is, it's no surprise to me.

244
00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:50.520
Because after all, Whitebeard is just a...

245
00:21:52.110 --> 00:21:54.090
loser from a bygone era!

246
00:21:56.330 --> 00:21:57.530
Ace!

247
00:21:59.030 --> 00:22:01.200
A loser?

248
00:22:03.360 --> 00:22:06.370
Take back what you just said!

249
00:22:06.370 --> 00:22:08.970
Hey, don't, Ace! Don't stop!

250
00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:11.380
He can say whatever he wants!

251
00:22:12.990 --> 00:22:15.710
He's mocking Pops.

252
00:22:15.710 --> 00:22:16.810
Ace!

253
00:22:16.810 --> 00:22:18.730
Did you ask me to take it back?

254
00:22:19.290 --> 00:22:23.790
That'll never happen! And here's why.

255
00:22:24.580 --> 00:22:28.760
Your real father, Gold Roger, conquered the Grand Line...

256
00:22:28.760 --> 00:22:35.200
and opened the door to the Great Pirate Era.

257
00:22:36.150 --> 00:22:38.720
As a Navy admiral, I shouldn't be the one to say this...

258
00:22:38.720 --> 00:22:42.510
but he was true to his name:
the King of the Pirates!

259
00:22:42.510 --> 00:22:46.910
In comparison, what has Whitebeard done?

260
00:22:47.780 --> 00:22:52.210
I wonder if he really had
the intention to fight...

261
00:22:52.210 --> 00:22:55.600
I assume that he established
a large family somewhere...

262
00:22:55.600 --> 00:22:59.790
and was satisfied with being a big fish in a little barrel.

263
00:22:59.790 --> 00:23:02.210
There are some fools in this world...

264
00:23:02.210 --> 00:23:06.840
who say that he was able to keep the peace on various islands...

265
00:23:06.840 --> 00:23:12.000
but in my opinion, all he did was make weak pirates live in fear of him...

266
00:23:12.000 --> 00:23:15.040
and he thinks that it made him a hero! What a joke!

267
00:23:15.040 --> 00:23:19.390
When Roger was around, Whitebeard was always second in billing...

268
00:23:19.390 --> 00:23:23.280
and even after he died, Whitebeard could never become the King.

269
00:23:23.280 --> 00:23:28.360
He was never able to surpass Roger...
and that makes him a loser in life!

270
00:23:28.360 --> 00:23:31.690
That is the truth about Whitebeard.

271
00:23:33.590 --> 00:23:39.640
When you think about it, his existence was sad. He gathered a bunch of punks who called him Pops...

272
00:23:39.640 --> 00:23:42.670
and roamed the seas
with his fake family.

273
00:23:42.670 --> 00:23:43.870
Stop it.

274
00:23:43.870 --> 00:23:46.710
And although he reigned the sea for decades...

275
00:23:46.710 --> 00:23:49.800
he couldn't become the King, and gained nothing

276
00:23:49.800 --> 00:23:55.810
and at the end, he was stabbed by a fool, one of his sons who fell for my trick...

277
00:23:55.810 --> 00:23:58.180
and now he will die to protect that son.

278
00:23:58.740 --> 00:24:02.210
Don't you think that he lived a worthless life?

279
00:24:03.090 --> 00:24:04.150
Stop it!

280
00:24:04.150 --> 00:24:05.860
Don't do it, Ace, come back!

281
00:24:05.860 --> 00:24:10.690
Pops gave us a home!

282
00:24:10.690 --> 00:24:14.780
You'll never understand his greatness!

283
00:24:15.830 --> 00:24:20.380
People don't deserve to live
if they can't live justly!

284
00:24:20.380 --> 00:24:24.070
Punks like you guys don't
deserve a place to live!

285
00:24:24.070 --> 00:24:25.310
Stop it!

286
00:24:25.470 --> 00:24:31.150
Whitebeard will die as a loser! It's
fitting for a big fish in a little barrel!

287
00:24:31.150 --> 00:24:34.720
Whitebeard is a great pirate
who shaped this era!

288
00:24:38.390 --> 00:24:42.190
Don't make fun of the man who saved me!

289
00:24:42.190 --> 00:24:44.160
Don't do it, Ace!

290
00:24:44.160 --> 00:24:47.430
The name of this era is "Whitebeard!"

291
00:24:58.680 --> 00:25:02.210
Both Whitebeard and those who called him Pops...

292
00:25:02.210 --> 00:25:04.180
are just losers!

293
00:25:09.120 --> 00:25:10.790
Ace was burned!

294
00:25:15.990 --> 00:25:19.740
Are you being careless because you ate...

295
00:25:19.740 --> 00:25:22.180
a Logia type Devil Fruit, the most powerful type?!

296
00:25:22.180 --> 00:25:27.170
You're just fire. My magma can burn even you!

297
00:25:27.480 --> 00:25:31.740
My powers are far superior to yours!

298
00:25:31.740 --> 00:25:33.780
Ace!

299
00:25:36.080 --> 00:25:39.650
Hey, Luffy-kun, you shouldn't fight anymore!

300
00:25:42.920 --> 00:25:44.450
Ace's Vivre Card!

301
00:25:47.120 --> 00:25:51.560
Gold Roger the Pirate King and Dragon the Revolutionary!

302
00:25:51.560 --> 00:25:55.850
I was surprised to hear that the sons of those two were blood-brothers.

303
00:25:56.590 --> 00:25:59.710
You're both criminals by blood!

304
00:25:59.710 --> 00:26:04.810
I don't care if the others get
away as long as I get you two!

305
00:26:05.100 --> 00:26:06.780
Watch what I do.

306
00:26:10.010 --> 00:26:11.480
Wait!

307
00:26:13.590 --> 00:26:15.190
Luffy!
